title: Soft-Sovereignty Government

You should not be seeing this text! report a bug :)

@ciu_led
title: [+ parlament_current_ciu +]-ERC <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="[+ parlament_current_ciu +] erc" data-summary="Minority government"><span style="color: var(--pdcat); font-style: italic;">Soft</span>-<span style="font-style: italic; color: var(--[+ parlament_current_ciu +]);">Sovereignty</span> <span style="color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;">Government</span></span>
view-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and parlament_current_ciu_s >= erc_parlament_s and player_party = "erc"
choose-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and parlament_current_ciu_s >= erc_parlament_s
subtitle: The pdcat is willing to support such government as long as the CUP is excluded from it.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.pdcat_external_support = true;
    Q.parlament_current_ciu_roadmap = Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_roadmap"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_pdcat_support_s = Q.parlament_current_ciu_s + Q.erc_parlament_s + Q.pdcat_parlament_s;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_ciu_erc.erc

@erc_led
title: ERC-[+ parlament_current_ciu +] <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc [+ parlament_current_ciu +]" data-summary="Minority government"><span style="color: var(--pdcat); font-style: italic;">Soft</span>-<span style="font-style: italic; color: var(--erc);">Sovereignty</span> <span style="color: var(--[+ parlament_current_ciu +]); font-style: italic;">Government</span></span>
view-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and erc_parlament_s > parlament_current_ciu_s and player_party = "erc"
choose-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and erc_parlament_s > parlament_current_ciu_s
subtitle: The pdcat is willing to support such government as long as the CUP is excluded from it.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.pdcat_external_support = true;
    Q.parlament_current_ciu_roadmap = Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_roadmap"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_pdcat_support_s = Q.parlament_current_ciu_s + Q.erc_parlament_s + Q.pdcat_parlament_s;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_erc_ciu.erc

@ciu_led_cup
title: [+ parlament_current_ciu +]-ERC <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="[+ parlament_current_ciu +] erc" data-summary="Minority government"><span style="color: var(--pdcat); font-style: italic;">Soft</span>-<span style="font-style: italic; color: var(--[+ parlament_current_ciu +]);">Sovereignty</span> <span style="color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;">Government</span></span>
view-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and parlament_current_ciu_s >= erc_parlament_s and player_party = "cup"
choose-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and parlament_current_ciu_s >= erc_parlament_s and erc_relations > 40
subtitle: The pdcat will provide the missing votes only if the CUP remains outside the cabinet. It is always an option for us to stand aside and allow [+ parlament_current_ciu +] and ERC to attempt this arrangement.
unavailable-subtitle: We need better relations with ERC before we can mediate this agreement.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.pdcat_external_support = true;
    Q.parlament_current_ciu_roadmap = Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_roadmap"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_pdcat_support_s = Q.parlament_current_ciu_s + Q.erc_parlament_s + Q.pdcat_parlament_s;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_ciu_erc.cup

@erc_led_cup
title: ERC-[+ parlament_current_ciu +] <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc [+ parlament_current_ciu +]" data-summary="Minority government"><span style="color: var(--pdcat); font-style: italic;">Soft</span>-<span style="font-style: italic; color: var(--erc);">Sovereignty</span> <span style="color: var(--[+ parlament_current_ciu +]); font-style: italic;">Government</span></span>
view-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and erc_parlament_s > parlament_current_ciu_s and player_party = "cup"
choose-if: parlament_pdcat_support_available and erc_parlament_s > parlament_current_ciu_s and erc_relations > 40
subtitle: The pdcat will provide the missing votes only if the CUP remains outside the cabinet. We can stand aside and allow ERC and [+ parlament_current_ciu +] to attempt this arrangement.
unavailable-subtitle: We need better relations with ERC before we can mediate this agreement.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.pdcat_external_support = true;
    Q.parlament_current_ciu_roadmap = Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_roadmap"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_pdcat_support_s = Q.parlament_current_ciu_s + Q.erc_parlament_s + Q.pdcat_parlament_s;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_erc_ciu.cup
